# BATS and NABE

BATS is a subtropical North Atlantic site; NABE represents the temperate
North Atlantic. Their seasonal light and mixing differ.

## 1. Locations

The station map uses the annual-mean **VIIRS CAFE** net primary production field
for **2023**, masked to **open-ocean waters deeper than 200 m** so the colour
background emphasises the basin-scale Atlantic structure rather than shelves and
coasts.

